# What the v2 backend (backend/aethel) needs, and nothing else: the installed app sets up exactly this.
# The lock, core.txt, is generated from it (with hashes), so every install gets the same files:
#   frontend_app\src-tauri\payload\uv\uv.exe pip compile backend\requirements\core.in --generate-hashes
#       --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-pc-windows-msvc -o backend\requirements\core.txt
# (pnpm bundle:prepare fetches that uv). The versions are the ones the test suites run against.

